==English==

===Etymology===
From a moment on the TV series ''[[w:Happy Days|Happy Days]]'' in which the character Fonzie jumped over a shark on waterskis

===Verb===
'''jump the shark'''

# {{idiom|of a [[television program]] or other [[narrative]]}} To undergo a [[storyline]] development which is so [[ridiculous]] that previous [[quality]] is considered to have been lost.
#: ''Happy Days '''jumped the shark''' when Fonzie jumped over a shark on waterskis.''

